  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a ttukbaegi earthenware skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the myeolchi anchovies and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the gochujang, soy sauce, and brown sugar.",
    "Pour the gochujang mixture over the anchovies and stir to combine.",
    "Add the yeast extract and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and serve hot."
